{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "c678f360243662d14be3c5e0ff4c75bf583f9a2c5b77036ac3bd147df0a35571", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。\nおはようごじゃいま、ふわぁ……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n早安……呼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e627b8d1a66f3c4c717dd7a94379730770d9095a87c159d56e3f20dccefea142", "ja": "亜利沙、おはよう……って、ずいぶんお疲れだな。\n昨日の運動会の疲れが、まだ残ってるのか？", "zh": "亚利沙，早安……你看起来很累呢，\n昨天运动会的疲劳还没消除吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "9565ac3d8834eb3f712ebe8405c757e96e461709aeacddf2d6d3d83f9962c963", "ja": "そうですね……。昨日は昼も夜も大フィーバーで、\nありさ、若干燃え尽きちゃいました……。", "zh": "对呀……昨天从早到晚都很兴奋，\n亚利沙有点燃烧殆尽了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f048d6d583c207a235203e53f29342aad8af13a5a5fe6bda4c7c72bc2ade9117", "ja": "……ん、夜も？", "zh": "……嗯？晚上也是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "e98c87a0c735ea85d8202dd8dea29bb84fc646b454fcc84bcbbd7e776ddb7dc8", "ja": "ムフフ……実は運動会で撮れた新鮮な写真を見ながら、\nアイドルちゃんデータベースの更新をしてたんです！", "zh": "唔呼呼……其实亚利沙昨晚一边看着运动会拍到的\n热腾腾新照片，一边在更新偶像宝贝资料库！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "3203727b36c1ea5bbee121cbd9e11f2f2ce4f4468a70788a1c8466382e049edc", "ja": "ひとりで部屋にこもって、思い出を噛みしめる……！\nくうぅ～……！　これぞ至福のひととき！", "zh": "一个人窝在房间里细细回味……！\n哎呀～！真是无比幸福的时光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "ca8819b47b85b045f493049e4331c84e4b0dc2fcce6d48397686234f695bdef4", "ja": "アイドルちゃんたちに夢中になってると、\nありさ、ついつい時間を忘れちゃうんです！", "zh": "沉浸在偶像宝贝的世界里，\n亚利沙常会不小心就忘了时间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "de3e3d6eb18aed8c7afc2e59728fbdfda248a50d238832260ba09b209aac3ff1", "ja": "そして……気がついたら、\n外が明るくなってて……ふわぁ……。", "zh": "然后呢……一回过神，\n外面天就亮了……呵啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "01df953a423ae8de1d04e7d1084c0e1abda06ecf6b88e3b5504040bfa43b585a", "ja": "つまり、全然寝てないって事じゃないか。\nそんな調子で、今日のレッスンは大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "也就是说你根本没睡嘛！\n你这个样子，今天的训练课程没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "0399c5f4a587dfcf138d805030591dc333b4d5e82b57bfee785c4e54ee32ef01", "ja": "う～ん。このままだとダメかもしれません。なので\n{$P$}さんに、ひとつお願いが……！", "zh": "唔～这样下去可能真的不行，所以，\n亚利沙有件事想拜托{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d25fffd7c18c8f7793f381c32e24b83aaaa2c41b27fc5c2ebb6cfb3219bee7e5", "ja": "……嫌な予感もするけど、一応聞いておこう。", "zh": "……虽然有股不好的预感，但姑且听一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "08271311a8ebf4d39382422ec0b0e017f7a63af5a333a81b796903956d0e87fd", "ja": "では、ずばり……\n昨日のパン食い競走の動画、見せてください～っ！", "zh": "那亚利沙就直说了……\n请给亚利沙看昨天咬面包赛跑的影片～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7c6a73b4ccccbecd0552d7c0026859f75a4d7e4b37474f2a108aad0b812c9336", "ja": "パン食い競走……亜利沙も出場してた？\n確かに、記録用の動画は撮ってあるけど……。", "zh": "咬面包赛跑……亚利沙你也有出场吗？\n我是有拍记录用的影片啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "43acaf1eca14e72452cf196c45a68ce5027746843fa4ea484ca452cab3b06da1", "ja": "ふおぉーっ！　それそれ！　それです！\nそれを、ありさに見せてくださいっ！", "zh": "唔喔喔──！没错没错！就是那个！\n请让亚利沙看那个影片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "5d46a5c957bbe4d9ad6a5ded439c29c437bc06d78951063da78090167f7eb313", "ja": "ぴょんぴょん跳ねてる風花さんが、最高に\nキュートだったって、ネットで大評判なんですっ！！", "zh": "网路上都在大力称赞\n蹦蹦跳的风花姊超可爱的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "7ecd21ac32e33c1ee643b8ad52d97012d3c0dc6800006103b6fcb3abae78ddeb", "ja": "ありさも出場してたので、\nパン食い競走は撮影できてなかったんですよ～！", "zh": "就是因为亚利沙也有出场，\n所以没拍到咬面包赛跑的比赛啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e2310cf02cea6b80944f462aded55565d9c218eb84c052677313d2e10c046c96", "ja": "な、なるほど……競技中は亜利沙も真剣だったからな。\n他のレーンを見ている余裕もなかった、ってことか。", "zh": "原、原来如此……这也代表你比赛时也很认真，\n都没空看其他赛道了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "9ec7d3da7d78cae403d3f206d2787b42f4fd911c92628bb00302f53322ce7d81", "ja": "もし、その動画をありさに見せてくれたら、\n今日のレッスンも元気にがんばれる気がします～！", "zh": "如果你让亚利沙看那段影片，\n亚利沙一定能活力满满地上完今天的训练课程～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "b8ac52a6a95db4fed2c6b867b3037b92be8ece15a2fdb55a390964ee317b81d4", "ja": "だから！　どうか！　お願いします～！\n大事に、大事に見ますからぁ～！　……ムフッ♪", "zh": "所以！真心诚意地！拜托了～！\n亚利沙会很珍惜、很珍惜地看的～！唔呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0103_1019_p", "source_sha256": "44bacb1ab6ef1f0966133cb7e12442b62defb3d07bf719aa68e183b6e73c52ab", "ja": "（その後、動画を見た亜利沙はすっかり元気になり、\nレッスンにも支障は出なかった。結果オーライ、か？）", "zh": "（之后，看了影片的亚利沙完全打起精神，\n也没影响到训练课程，应该算是圆满结局吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
